                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.1531/65: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Lay</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-03-13T19:00:00-05:00">March 13, 1935—7 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>12. Your 14, March 12, 2 p.m. The Department sees no reason for making any
                    statement.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
